{"data":{"id":9753,"title":"Bài 5: Gỡ Lỗi Lập Trình Phòng Thủ: Lỗi Self-Invocation & Trôi Ngữ Cảnh Security","description":"<html><head></head><body><p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài 5: Gỡ Lỗi Lập Trình Phòng Thủ: Lỗi Self-Invocation &amp; Trôi Ngữ Cảnh Security</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bối cảnh</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tại&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>RikkeiPay</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, khi giao dịch chuyển tiền thành công, hệ thống cần thực thi một tiến trình ghi nhận dữ liệu giao dịch chi tiết (Audit Log) bất đồng bộ (</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">@Async</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">) để tránh làm nghẽn luồng API chính của khách hàng. Luồng bất đồng bộ này cần lấy thông tin người dùng đang thực hiện giao dịch thông qua&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">SecurityContextHolder</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">. Tuy nhiên, mã nguồn giả lập bên dưới đang gặp lỗi nghiêm trọng: tiến trình API của khách hàng vẫn bị block 2 giây (đồng bộ) và thông tin Security Context bị mất dẫn đến lỗi&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">NullPointerException</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Đoạn code Java bị lỗi như sau:</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"table\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-style:none;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\" width=\"651\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#12324a;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:2.25pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#ffffff;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>JAVA</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt;\"><td style=\"background-color:#f4f6f8;overflow-wrap:break-word;overflow:hidden;padding:4.75pt 5.75pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; package com.rikkeipay.service;</span></span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; import org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired;</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; import org.springframework.scheduling.annotation.Async;</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; import org.springframework.security.core.context.SecurityContextHolder;</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; import org.springframework.stereotype.Service;</span></span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; @Service</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; public class BankTransactionService {</span></span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; public void executeTransfer(String toAccount, double amount) {</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // Nghiệp vụ xử lý chuyển tiền trong Core Banking DB...</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; System.out.println(\"Core Banking: Transferred \" + amount + \" to account \" + toAccount);</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // Gọi phương thức ghi chép kiểm toán bất đồng bộ</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; this.writeAuditLog(toAccount, amount);</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; @Async</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; public void writeAuditLog(String toAccount, double amount) {</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // Lấy thông tin người thực hiện giao dịch (Audit Log)</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; String currentUser = SecurityContextHolder.getContext().getAuthentication().getName();</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; System.out.println(\"Audit log: transaction initiated by user \" + currentUser);</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // Giả lập tiến trình ghi Audit Log tốn thời gian</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; try {</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Thread.sleep(2000);</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; } catch (InterruptedException e) {</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; e.printStackTrace();</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; System.out.println(\"Audit log successfully written to database for transaction to \" + toAccount);</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Đề bài</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bạn hãy thực hiện:</span></span></p><ol style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Giải thích nguyên nhân gốc rễ dẫn đến lỗi 1 (Lỗi Self-Invocation khiến proxy&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">@Async</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> bị bỏ qua và chạy đồng bộ) và lỗi 2 (Trôi ngữ cảnh Thread khiến&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">SecurityContextHolder</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> bị null trong luồng chạy bất đồng bộ).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Viết mã nguồn Java refactor lại đoạn mã trên: tách lớp dịch vụ ghi audit log riêng biệt, cấu hình đúng cơ chế quản lý Thread Pool thông qua&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">spring.security.task.executor</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> hoặc sử dụng&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">DelegatingSecurityContextExecutor</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> để truyền context của Spring Security sang các luồng con một cách an toàn.</span></span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu đầu ra</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bản phân tích chi tiết nguyên nhân lỗi tự gọi (self-invocation) và trôi ngữ cảnh luồng.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mã nguồn các file Java đã được refactor tối ưu (các class dịch vụ và file cấu hình Task Executor).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Đóng gói mã nguồn bài tập trong một project độc lập và đẩy lên GitHub (nộp kèm link GitHub Repository riêng cho bài này).</span></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Minh chứng chạy thực tế</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: Dán log console chạy thực tế chứng minh phương thức giao dịch chính và luồng ghi audit log chạy bất đồng bộ trên 2 Thread khác nhau và lấy được User trong Security Context thành công.</span></span></p></body></html>","createdBy":"84","createdAt":"2026-08-11T03:08:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-15T03:14:08.000Z","updatedBy":"81","status":1,"position":7310,"tutorial":"","gradingCriteria":"","sampleLink":"","expectedTime":15},"statusCode":200}